[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2567960895","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100621#issuecomment-2567960895","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100621","id":2567960895,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZD_k_","user":{"login":"DarioSamo","id":538504,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODUwNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/538504?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo","html_url":"https://github.com/DarioSamo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-02T15:35:58Z","updated_at":"2025-01-02T15:35:58Z","body":"> However, looking at the code I can see that we often call make_rid from functions which can be called from any thread. This makes me think that we do need to be using the thread safe attribute for the RID_Owners.\n\nThat'd be correct, although I recall @RandomShaper wasn't quite sure how true it was. I can take a second look as it was indeed pushed to a TODO until the other PR was merged.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2567960895/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2569375530","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100621#issuecomment-2569375530","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100621","id":2569375530,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZJY8q","user":{"login":"RandomShaper","id":11797174,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzk3MTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11797174?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper","html_url":"https://github.com/RandomShaper","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-03T15:10:54Z","updated_at":"2025-01-03T15:10:54Z","body":"I don't quite remember the details now, but I can still state the following:\n\nNon-thread-safe RID allocators, the way they are implemented now, shouldn't be used without external synchronization if they can be used from multiple threads, regardless concurrently or not.\n\nIf we have a case where we know no concurrent access will happen, but still different threads may use the owner at different points in time, either they need to become thread-safe, or we need to add a semi-thread-safe mode. It's like what I've done in a PR for making thread-safe RID owners really safe, but would apply to every operation, not only getting.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2569375530/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]